Bootstrap: docker
From: rust:1.82

%files
    ../decirational/Cargo.toml /opt/decirational/Cargo.toml
    ../decirational/Cargo.lock /opt/decirational/Cargo.lock
    ../decirational/src /opt/decirational/src

%post
    cd /opt/decirational
    cargo build --release
    cp target/release/decirational /usr/local/bin/decirational

%runscript
    exec decirational "$@"

%labels
    Application Decirational
    Language Rust
    RustVersion 1.82

%help
    Decirational calculator (Rust implementation).
    Usage: apptainer run decirational.sif [--integer=decimal|tight] [--format=<format>] [--precision=N]
    Then type arithmetic expressions (supporting + - * / % ^, parentheses,
    [floor brackets] and |absolute value bars|) one per line on stdin.
